    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3251f4bd665dfd93265fee1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然个性有点难以掌控，但一定能跑出好表现的。\n首先就以出道战为目标好好努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02f7944c35c49a37f40350dc2498d8a6c043d453b497afe41abc0518f8241a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9c65e768d4356cd7ab7db25",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新光风登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5aad333fbe9d59df3c33fbd2c431fe8f71622e1b6304dc05b37ae11e84076931",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb0d861433a9038fd55c4526",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcda1fd33e7cdc60071e0c84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新光风渴望在出道战赢得众人的目光。\n她甚至为了带动沙土比赛的热潮，\n正在计划制作PV。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d3f2acbb0a13697e2fff288750640806db061a79e4853ee798ce344a2478f04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b34eac1cc744ca819139889",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67edc5508c2b882dbddd3de2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在同为沙土选手同伴的建议下，\n决定尝试以学园官方影片的方式推动PV，\n而前往学生会办公室商讨此事──",
      "source_fingerprint": "42136730d72801a4d69b8fad528404ed374ec4d4869e162c34f2c5a82244aec9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18429569c1dfb1d6884f8334",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b613de9c7e7e56aa47befb8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "学生会的干部却不在。这时却出现了\n对正义英雄感到憧憬的微光飞驹。\n遭她质疑是否正盘算着什么坏主意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95cd55cd1546ae24b984c6ebae93b76c649f0f651945f10440a326c7face3fc5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d65e50c6a289ef61b9c5df1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:682973fdbb37fd81c32fb641",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽顺利解开了误会，\n但她表示无法对立志当坏蛋的存在置之不理。\n新光风则因受到注意而感到开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdbebebf19f7dee7629d69269373f59186feb39a7cfac54c775e6fa82c27f51f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d40a79e5327737d045b85f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:100ce8089fba86b44b9e6ef6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许，\n将来会在赛场上遇到微光飞驹也不一定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e17ab691e8fd7a3602c2e5a73a64cf6153d72a2d2c0cd74644fe24d409c62fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bbc9afeff9bdda0e0588f5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "沙土与愉快的伙伴们",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a533d218a10463dc9b440aa19fe2e95fb46cb594f21b690d6e0917de846598a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81f20464afb273d8af3473d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb9575e99b4b75b7a4f2c595",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "朝着“独角兽S”而努力的每一天。\n新光风则腻于日复一日相同的训练\n而表示烦躁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35b3f4e39d5758de7cd99ac894515f7731c9fc7e7a9d8f741743cea144db551e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f506e5f8fd5c1f6c0a17ec7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fed530c1dc65a5913c9e478b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这时一个好消息来到。\n她收到一场将会全国转播的\n表演赛的参赛邀请。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeed8883c857f51e2adca6851b2e1b7d8d4cdb0c39687770cb962a2d1f8b2427",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9deb6fc8efb7d2ec21bf1a7c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a442e878aebbd170b775c476",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要展现会在竞赛界轰动一百年的实力。\n实现这个“野心”的机会降临了！\n新光风非常开心地一口答应。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd8191ef839084274e4b0dddf42f5ac5a53f7cd46a52d789c26fd98107354887",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90cc6409b44568ad30bf78b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df3bb90ab44fdf493eadd9c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新光风再次努力投入训练，\n并连续几日都不断刷新自己的纪录。\n成功发挥集中力的她相当优秀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5266f0dd0dd3c7c797f4f56b3fef046025e602cbb497a6b64276203795ba59f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16e987ab7e0ee73ead9f9a10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:637bebf6b7edb67da1277981",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员因此相信她必定会赢下比赛，\n并同时会是实现“野心”的一大步。\n……至少当时是如此深信着的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "441873b5734c925f754e54c086f09e1f2ac8944c0496831ef1d9da33ffc09e97",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d902a725696d82ccbd8964ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从天而降的绝佳机会",
      "source_fingerprint": "13dc1ec02aae2c31b74ed805c35398acf778d8226bc44b9583a796925073f342",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14d085e7477de862bd41f4f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "表演赛当天。\n新光风为了今天撑过了严苛的训练。\n而这场期待已久的比赛即将开始──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d98647e2e0c76bc7c8f451b67960d1f3207adac1c32ef2b5746b3427dc650f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b29b264a6ee16a0df9889a61",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，却在比赛中意识到自己可能会输掉比赛。\n这样子是无法实现“野心”的──\n于是她忍不住咬了其他选手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "184b14f8fbd98b4aa574d28059d7a489a7906ef7371e59fd3dd3197fd216bca7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1043/storytimeline_501043403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:740a1342d60d43c7e841aeb7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所幸，对方并没有因此受伤，\n但这起“咬人事件”\n却在瞬间就传遍了全国。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a65eac1fa6ebf21ceedd98303f83778ec2a747670cab95945f658d69c42aa410",
