      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后，\n深刻反省的新光风向对方真心致歉，\n并答应今后绝不在比赛时咬人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3df84ea4c934b2869b186db0a08665a834512e0fd9b334ea978e176b2e95f855",
