    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef1d3b564c79a7706336fa79",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一个目标是重赏比赛的“独角兽S”。\n她决定重新打起精神认真准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0633fa6c43256544037290603a254d73963ad74b93d9ad7de029add5174a5519",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
