      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新光风透过反复训练学会了“黑暗开关”。\n这个策略提升了她的集中力，\n让她有信心准备在“东海S”取胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3329cda6a0ff2507341056bece9e958c58e12ff6376e299e67ee2b3c42da936a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
